  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "Nariman House, 2008. A voice on a phone from Pakistan: pile the mattresses at the top of the stairs."
    },
    {
      "text": "The FBI calls him the chief planner of 26/11. His name is Sajid Mir."
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Pakistan let the world believe he was dead."
    },
    {
      "text": "Until a financial watchdog needed proof. Arrested. Convicted. Never for Mumbai."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Voice in the Room. Now on The Sisodia Files."
    }
  ],
